        "id": "p2",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Today, pets are more than just animals. People buy them birthday cakes, holiday gift boxes, and even take them to "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "beauty salons",
            "zh": "美容院"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "! Pets can help people feel happy and less "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b3",
            "number": 3
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ". "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "Scientists",
            "ref": "v-scientist"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " say playing with pets helps our bodies "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "release",
            "zh": "释放"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " “"
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b4",
            "number": 4
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "hormones",
            "zh": "荷尔蒙"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "”."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p3",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "“We treat our pets as family members,” says Lin Qi, a pet "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b5",
            "number": 5
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ". “I want my "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "furry",
            "ref": "v-furry"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " baby to look good every day.” What a lovely way to show "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b6",
            "number": 6
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "! Do you hug your pet today?"
          }
        ]
      }
